  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>糞便（Manure）模組會讓動物定期掉落糞便物品。預設情況下每天掉落兩次，但這可以自行設定。糞便可作為骨粉的替代品，用於生成草叢／花朵或加速作物生長。也可以從分配器中使用。適用於任何繼承了 Animal 類別的模組生物。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"環境：客戶端 &amp; 伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>manureDropDelayTicks</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 12000，最小值 0，最大值 10000000<br>已載入的動物之間掉落糞便的延遲刻數。20 刻等於 1 秒。預設為每天兩次，每 12000 刻掉落一次。</p>\n</details>\n<p><br><br><span><strong>黑名單：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><span>模組首次載入時會產生一份黑名單，位置位於 <em><strong>./config/manure/blacklist.txt</strong></em>。</span><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/manure/e.png\" alt=\"\"><span>在此處您可以透過在名稱前加上驚嘆號（!）來停用特定動物掉落糞便的功能。<br>預設情況下，美西螈、蜜蜂與青蛙已被停用。</span><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/manure/f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"實機展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>牛掉落糞便：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/manure/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span><strong>使用分配器投放糞便：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/manure/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍保留於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若您有任何問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
